{"version":2,"slug":"real-life-english-conversations","videoId":"bY_6GwXJHZs","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/bY_6GwXJHZs","lang":"en","title":"Real-Life English Conversations","category":"Daily life","channel":"Shadowing English Speaking Practice","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"If [music] you want to sound more"},{"start":3,"text":"natural in English,"},{"start":6,"text":"don't just study English, shadow it."},{"start":11,"text":"Welcome to this shadowing practice"},{"start":15,"text":"compilation."},{"start":16,"text":"In this video,"},{"start":18,"text":"we're going to practice from beginning"},{"start":21,"text":"to end using real English. If you've"},{"start":25,"text":"never tried shadowing before,"},{"start":29,"text":"then don't worry."},{"start":30,"text":"It's one of the best ways to improve"},{"start":34,"text":"your pronunciation,"},{"start":36,"text":"your listening,"},{"start":37,"text":"and your confidence all at the same"},{"start":41,"text":"time. Here's how it works."},{"start":44,"text":"I'll say a sentence first, then you"},{"start":48,"text":"repeat. Not just the words, but also the"},{"start":53,"text":"pronunciation,"},{"start":55,"text":"the rhythm, the pauses,"},{"start":58,"text":"the emotion. The more you imitate native"},{"start":63,"text":"speech,"},{"start":64,"text":"the more natural your English will"},{"start":67,"text":"become."},{"start":68,"text":"So, if you can, stay until the end. Your"},{"start":72,"text":"English is going to feel more automatic"},{"start":76,"text":"every time you practice. And remember,"},{"start":79,"text":"you don't become fluent by knowing"},{"start":83,"text":"English."},{"start":84,"text":"You become fluent by using it. So, find"},{"start":88,"text":"a comfortable place"},{"start":90,"text":"and let's start shadowing together."},{"start":93,"text":"Hello."},{"start":